  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: feb267bcfa6a3824c8bfa454015aaab5, type: 3}
  paragraphs:
  - "AURORA: \u201CThey won\u2019t beat me again, Aurora\u201D That\u2019s what you
    said right? "
  - 'COSMO: Hmm, yeah.'
  - "AURORA: Oh Cos, I\u2019m just joking around. At least now, we know that you
    coming back to life wasn\u2019t just a one-time thing. "
  - "COSMO: Right... Well, at least it\u2019s good to know that you wouldn\u2019t
    make light of my actual death, Aurora."
  - "AURORA: You don\u2019t know that. "
  - '*phone rings*'
  - 'SKIPPY: Gyehaha! You look like you almost died, twice!'
  - 'COSMO: I did die, twice! '
  - "SKIPPY: And you came to Ol\u2019 Skippy to finally kill you once and for all."
  - "COSMO:  What? Oh, don\u2019t be foolish Skippy you old coot. I came to my best
    pal for help, the \u201Cgreatest\u201D mechanic on the entire \u2018US Space-Corp'. "
  - "SKIPPY: Shut your trap. I AM the best. That\u2019s why you asked for me ain\u2019t
    it?"
  - "AURORA: The captain did ask for you specifically Skippy. Despite the front he\u2019s
    trying to put on, he really needs your help."
  - "SKIPPY: That so then... What\u2019d ya need? "
  - 'COSMO: I need you to fix up the ship. '
  - 'COSMO: I think the ship is why I keep coming back. Can you investigate it and
    see what you come up with?'
  - 'COSMO: And uh...while you''re at it...the ship could use some upgrades.'
  - "SKIPPY: Oh yeah sure, I\u2019ll even throw in some adult diapers to help the
    people that do your laundry, so they don\u2019t have wash your piss-stained suit. "
  - 'AURORA: Wow.'
  - "COSMO: He\u2019ll do it."
  - "SKIPPY: Before you go thinking the Space Corp has infinite resources, we don\u2019t.
    I\u2019m gonna need you to supply some S.C.O.R.E. while you\u2019re out there
    if you want your upgrades."
  - 'COSMO: What the hell is S.C.O.R.E? Like in a video game?'
  - "SKIPPY: No, not like in a video game! This is real life god damn it. S.C.O.R.E.
    CLEARLY stands for Scrap Collected on Recent Expeditions. Isn\u2019t it obvious? "
  - "COSMO: That\u2019s so dumb, Skippy. So dumb."
  - "SKIPPY: Ah whatever. It\u2019s smart and you know it. You try saying \u201CScrap
    Collected on Recent Expeditions\u201D 10 times in a row. "
  - 'COSMO: Scrap Collected on Recent Expeditions Scrap Collected on Recent Expeditions
    Scrap Collected on Recent Expeditions-'
  - "SKIPPY: Oh whatever, just collect me some S.C.O.R.E. and I\u2019ll have your
    upgrades sorted lickity split. Come to my workshop if you need anything. "
  - "COSMO: ...You made this much more difficult than it needed to be. I\u2019ll
    try and \u201Csettle the score\u201D for you heh heh heh."
  - "Aurora: Good one, Cos. Glad to know you didn\u2019t lose that quick wit of yours
    from dying all the time."
